  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig 4, 'The stepwise approach used in this handbook'. Four coloured chevrons in a row: 1. Defining a holistic DHSC strategy; 2. Defining the DHSC architecture; 3. Planning for scalable implementation and sustainable operations; 4. Using the DHSC to implement traceability. Chevron 1 lists four steps (identify and engage stakeholders, analyse the current state of HSCISs, define the vision and strategic goals, define a strategic roadmap and performance indicators). Chevron 2 lists three (assess the current state of HSCISs, define a target architecture, identify implementation activities and map them to strategic goals). Chevron 3 lists four (plan the implementation, develop an operational plan, develop a budget, and implement each intervention). The crop also includes the chapter list and a 'Before using this handbook' box above the figure.",
